			"Message": "build: Update dependencies and adjust NPM publish workflow\n\nThis commit updates development dependencies including @playform/build to version 0.2.6 and @types/serviceworker to version 0.0.176. Additionally, the NPM publish workflow in .github/workflows/NPM.yml has been adjusted by removing the --provenance flag from the npm publish command due to compatibility issues.\n\nThe homepage URL in package.json was also updated to point directly to the readme overview tab for better accessibility.",
